  "The Canadian Entrepreneurs & Startups Council (CESC) was recently invited to attend Prime Minister Carney's Christmas Celebration in Ottawa, an event that symbolized understanding, respect, and cooperation.": "加拿大华商创业协会（CESC）近日受邀出席在渥太华举行的卡尼总理圣诞庆祝活动，该活动象征着理解、尊重与合作。",
