  "Enterprise Visit": "企业拜访",
  "November 23, 2025": "2025年11月23日",
  "Led by Vice President Eric Wu, the Canadian Entrepreneurs & Startups Council visited Hsin Hsin Holdings, a company deeply rooted in Vancouver for 35 years, exploring its three-generation legacy of art and culture, the cross-industry story of entrepreneur Emily Lin, and a professional and warm visitation experience, showcasing the aesthetic power and social responsibility of Chinese enterprises.": "由副会长Eric Wu带队，加拿大华商创业协会拜访了在温哥华深耕35年的新新集团，探寻其三代传承的艺术文化底蕴、Emily Lin跨界创业故事，以及专业而温馨的参观体验，彰显华人企业的美学力量与社会责任。",
  "Celebrating the 2025 National Day of Romanian Cuisine & Wine": "庆祝2025罗马尼亚美食美酒国庆日",
  "Diplomatic Exchange": "外交交流",
  "CESC was invited to attend the National Day of Romanian Cuisine & Wine, hosted in Vancouver, where business leaders, dignitaries, and cultural representatives from Romania, Canada, and other nations gathered to savor traditional Romanian food and fine wines.": "CESC受邀在温哥华出席罗马尼亚美食美酒国庆日，来自罗马尼亚、加拿大和其他国家的商界领袖、政要和文化代表齐聚一堂，品尝罗马尼亚传统美食和美酒。",
  "CESC 10th Board of Directors Summer Team Building Event Successfully Concluded": "CESC第十届理事会夏季团建活动圆满结束",
  "Association Activity": "协会活动",
