  "CESC Invited to Meet with Prime Minister Carney in Vancouver": "CESC受邀在温哥华与卡尼总理会面",
  "August 5, 2025": "2025年8月5日",
  "On August 3, 2025, CESC achieved a historic milestone as several directors and vice presidents were invited to a cordial meeting and photo opportunity with the Prime Minister of Canada.": "2025年8月3日，CESC迎来了历史性里程碑，多位理事和副会长受邀与加拿大总理进行了亲切会晤并合影留念。",
  "CESC's July Journey: An Expedition of Connection and Empowerment": "CESC七月之行：连接与赋能的远征",
  "CESC's July journey through China was a vibrant expedition of connection and empowerment, expanding the organization's reach and reinforcing its mission to unite global Chinese entrepreneurs for shared success and a new chapter of China-Canada business cooperation.": "CESC七月之行穿越中国，这是一次充满活力、连接与赋能的远征，拓展了协会的影响力，并重申了其团结全球华商实现共同成功、开启中加商业合作新篇章的使命。",
  "CESC Delegates Attend Zhang Jian's Practical Seminar, Gaining Insights into Sales Power in a Changing Era": "CESC代表团出席张健实战研讨会，洞悉时代变革中的销售力量",
  "June 1, 2025": "2025年6月1日",
