  "Company Visit --- Exploring Los Beans: The Sustainable Philosophy and Brand Depth Behind a Cup of Coffee": "企业拜访 | 探访Los Beans：一杯咖啡背后的永续理念与品牌深度",
  "April 19, 2025": "2025年4月19日",
  "CESC members visited the Los Beans roasting factory in Delta, British Columbia, uncovering the brand’s dedication to fair trade, sustainability, and ethical business practices.": "CESC会员参观了位于不列颠哥伦比亚省三角洲的Los Beans烘焙厂，共同探索该品牌在公平贸易、可持续发展和道德商业实践方面的努力。",
  "Connecting North American Business Opportunities | Mexico Trade and Investment Summit, Empowering Enterprises for Global Expansion!": "链接北美商业机遇 | 墨西哥贸易投资峰会，赋能企业全球拓展！",
  "CESC members were invited to a market information seminar on \"Mexico Trade and Investment Opportunities,\" co-hosted by the Consulate General of Mexico in Vancouver and the Government of British Columbia, which concluded successfully at the World Trade Centre.": "CESC会员受邀参加了墨西哥驻温哥华总领事馆与不列颠哥伦比亚省政府在世界贸易中心共同举办的“墨西哥贸易投资机会”市场信息研讨会，并圆满落幕。",
  "New Strength, New Journey — A Look at the 10th Secretariat of the Canadian Entrepreneurs & Startups Council": "新实力，新征程——加拿大华商创业协会第十届秘书处概览",
  "February 19, 2025": "2025年2月19日",
  "The 10th Secretariat of the Canadian Entrepreneurs & Startups Council comprises a new team dedicated to enhancing operations, fostering member engagement and collaboration, and expanding the association’s influence.": "加拿大华商创业协会第十届秘书处是一个致力于加强运营、促进会员参与与合作、并扩大协会影响力的新团队。",
  "CESC 2025 Annual Gala Successfully Held": "CESC 2025年度盛典成功举办",
  "The CESC 2025 Annual Gala successfully brought together global entrepreneurs and investors to discuss new opportunities in international capital cooperation and promote the deeper development of Chinese enterprises in the global market.": "CESC 2025年度盛典成功汇聚全球企业家和投资者，共同探讨国际资本合作新机遇，促进华人企业在全球市场更深入发展。",
